The first time you invoke a new capability — a snapshot, a sprint, project search, the thesaurus, and the rest — pstar now shows a one-line hint in the status area pointing you at where the feature lives next. The hint never steals focus, auto-dismisses after 4 seconds or on the next keypress, and never reappears once seen. Hints are suppressed entirely at help level 0 (^OH cycles the level), so a clean screen stays clean (R12.3, R12.4).
